  "details": "Setting to allow having menu to either be opened or to remain opened regardless of player locomotion. to be clear, I am Addressing the quick menu before opening the larger menu and not speaking to motion that isn't tied to the user directing their motion (getting launched by a world object for example). I am i requesting what would essentially be a QOL setting/feature to allow those users whom may suffer from common issues such as \"stick Drift\" to be able to not only open the menu but to be able to keep it open despite involuntary movement caused by a users Controllers which may be suffering from varying levels of situations which may constitute as \"drift\".",
